  "body": "Three bedrooms, a flexible room and a private north-facing rear garden. Residence 7 is an end home in the Forty West collection, with its own garden outlook.\r\n\r\nAsking $1,490,000 including GST. Freehold. 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms plus W/C, 3 levels and one internal garage. Approximate floor area: 149.41 m².\r\n\r\nThe kitchen projects beside a recessed garden patio, with an external servery counter for outdoor entertaining. Living is arranged over three levels, with the flexible entry-level room providing options for work or another living space. There are two bathrooms plus a separate W/C, and one internal garage.\r\n\r\nHazel Oak joinery, Taj Mahal benchtops, brushed-copper accents and Bremworth wool carpet bring warmth and texture to the proposed interiors. Refer to the specifications for your selected residence.\r\n\r\nConstruction is underway. The latest October site update shows the upper-floor frames delivered and ready for installation, with the shared driveway complete. Target handover is 31 March 2027, subject to construction progress, approvals and titles.\r\n\r\nAsk about opportunities to personalise selected finishes, subject to construction stage, developer approval and any agreed costs.\r\n\r\nExplore the floor plan, specifications and construction updates using the website link supplied with this listing or enquire to arrange a private appointment with Fraser Meads.\r\n\r\nView the website for more information: https://fortywest.co.nz\r\n\r\nRenders are artist impressions. Planting is shown at indicative maturity and will take time to establish. Final design, finishes and dimensions are subject to the sale documents.",
